---
title: 示例 - 霓虹深潜协议
mode: stage
speed: 42
designWidth: 1920
designHeight: 1080
bgColor: "#03040a"
fontColor: "#d8ffff"
fontFamily: monospace
---

// 镜头 1：DIP duotone 处理背景，entrance/behavior 只负责文字运动。
@ bg(src="tests/assets/sample-bg.jpg")
[align=center .duotone:bg(shadow="#08031a", highlight="#ff2bd6")]
{NIGHT CITY :: SUBLEVEL 09} @ f.fadeIn(duration=1).wave(height=4, freq=0.002).big.big

---

// 镜头 2：信号被拦截，三层 DIP 降解与短促入场协同。
@ bg(color="#07020d")
[align=center .scanline:block(density=4, curvature=0.1, flicker=0.06) .noise:block(amount=0.12, mono=1, scale=6) .rgbShift:block(dist=7, anim=true)]
{SIGNAL INTERCEPTED} @ f.jumpIn(height=70, duration=0.7).shake(strength=1.2).big.big

---

// 镜头 3：身份层发生扭曲和青色消散。
@ bg(color="#02030b")
[align=center]
{IDENTITY CORRUPTED} @ f.popIn(duration=0.65).warp(freq=15, amp=0.08, speed=0.03).dissolve(duration=2, edge="#00fff0").big.big

---

// 镜头 4：水下 DIP 处理像素；jumpIn + gravity + wave 组成跃入、下沉与水波运动。
@ bg(color="#020b18")
[align=center .underwater:block(amount=18, scale=6, tint="#03152c", highlight="#35d7ff", blur=1.2)]
{DESCENT PROTOCOL} @ f.jumpIn(height=110, duration=0.75).gravity(g=0.65, floor=520, bounce=0.32).wave(height=8, freq=0.003).big.big

---

// 镜头 5：追踪器在暗角中溶解，运动幅度收紧。
@ bg(color="#0b0209")
[align=center .vignette:block .dissolve:block(duration=1.6, edge="#ff2b7a", scale=11)]
{TRACE TERMINATED} @ f.fadeIn(duration=0.5).shake(strength=1.6).big.big

---

// 镜头 6：同一背景切换为 emboss surface profile，像取证存档端。
@ bg(src="tests/assets/sample-bg.jpg")
[align=center .emboss:bg(strength=1.5)]
{EVIDENCE VAULT :: SEALED} @ f.jumpIn(height=45, duration=0.55).big.big

---

// 镜头 7：容器扭曲吞没最后的退出指令。
@ bg(color="#010207")
[align=center .warp:block(freq=12, amp=0.06, speed=0.02)]
{GHOST LINK :: CLOSED} @ f.fadeIn(duration=0.8).wave(height=5, freq=0.002).big.big
